OL,3,GNEWSAAirlines criticise air traffic
OL,4,Acontrol as second glitch causes more
OL,5,Adisruption
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe technical problem at Prestwick
OL,8,Fcaused disruption at airports across
OL,9,FScotland, Northern Ireland and northern
OL,10,FEngland, with more than 200 flights
OL,11,Fcancelled.
OL,13,FNats said a "connectivity issue" was to
OL,14,Fblame for the disruption, and that it
OL,15,Fhad "nothing to do" with a separate
OL,16,Fsoftware defect at Swanwick that led to
OL,17,Fthe cancellation of 2,000 flights
OL,18,Fearlier in September.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
